                                        "entry_id": "22c65586-a892-3a81-aa1d-9b7f00fe46c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A revival; a bringing back to life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f151c42-6008-4cf3-beb3-d4f883d0ce6b",
                                                "sense_id": "a38d01e9-bf10-3042-86f7-bdb46135cb6f",
                                                "text": "I believe I may venture to say that I am not [mistaken] that where the divine life is implanted by the Spirit of the living God, that life admits of decrease and increase, admits of dreadful decays, and also of some blessed revivings."
                                            }
                                        ]
