                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11df9cbe-9113-3a1e-bfdb-12574d31ebd8",
                                        "entry_id": "b7040842-ca99-3b12-bf23-929a7a70acb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Renewed interest, performance, cultivation, or flourishing state of something, as of culture, commerce, agriculture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "625bce3f-367b-4ffd-8df9-e4db93aa0f74",
                                                "sense_id": "11df9cbe-9113-3a1e-bfdb-12574d31ebd8",
                                                "text": "post-punk revival"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "debd00d9-ef90-4bbc-bbc3-192a496fe9b4",
                                                "sense_id": "11df9cbe-9113-3a1e-bfdb-12574d31ebd8",
                                                "text": "The Met's recent revival of Jürgen Flimm's powerful production of Beethoven's “Fidelio,” another highlight of the 2000-1 season, was a similar letdown. But revivals of great productions don't always have to be disappointments, as the Met's current presentation of Poulenc's “Dialogues des Carmélites” makes clear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ec62285-57a1-4759-9dc4-b2ca845af6f6",
                                                "sense_id": "11df9cbe-9113-3a1e-bfdb-12574d31ebd8",
                                                "text": "But then, this isn’t even the first time these genres are back, back, back. As DJ Ben UFO says: “There have been ‘jungle revivals’ regularly for at least as long as I’ve been DJing.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "163109aa-ed38-4793-9def-a0801e7e724d",
                                                "sense_id": "11df9cbe-9113-3a1e-bfdb-12574d31ebd8",
                                                "text": "After crossing the flatlands Lincoln, with its magnificent hilltop cathedral, comes into view before we pull into the station, with its lovely Tudor revival-style buildings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "990348d3-fa2b-37b8-8956-3ce72f68cf2a",
                                        "entry_id": "b7040842-ca99-3b12-bf23-929a7a70acb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Renewed prevalence of something, as a practice or a fashion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92779483-dc80-40f5-9122-dde2511d3f47",
                                                "sense_id": "990348d3-fa2b-37b8-8956-3ce72f68cf2a",
                                                "text": "the revival of hot pants"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c9cb4de-5379-4dfc-9a97-98be82680216",
                                                "sense_id": "990348d3-fa2b-37b8-8956-3ce72f68cf2a",
                                                "text": "Kat Frey, a 25-year-old copywriter who lives in Brooklyn, picked up the habit last year. “We’re having a very sexy and ethereal 1980s revival, and smoking is part of that,” she said. “A lot of people I know are posting pictures doing it. I’m doing it. It’s having its moment for sure.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "886a32e9-9bb7-32eb-ae60-9d0768a454a7",
                                        "entry_id": "b7040842-ca99-3b12-bf23-929a7a70acb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Renewed interest in religion, after indifference and decline; a period of religious awakening; special religious interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e6b9baa-f7d3-40a9-b9e4-ac2edfb276cd",
                                                "sense_id": "886a32e9-9bb7-32eb-ae60-9d0768a454a7",
                                                "text": "As the revivals died down in the 1740s, the revivalist camp made concessions to their opponents, admonished prorevivalists who continued with the hostilities, and generally sought to heal divisions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "516e843f-17aa-43b9-9f1e-54bf51e990e4",
                                                "sense_id": "886a32e9-9bb7-32eb-ae60-9d0768a454a7",
                                                "text": "This book offers a view into a growing movement of Islamic revival as it is taking place in the small, historically Hindu kingdom of Nepal on the northern Himalayan edge of the Indian subcontinent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbd09e40-d08f-4c23-8fea-0108181f0984",
                                                "sense_id": "886a32e9-9bb7-32eb-ae60-9d0768a454a7",
                                                "text": "While masturbation was never favored in Judeo-Christian tradition, Victorian morality, along with the Great Awakening and other religious revivals in America, created a perfect storm for people to really get obsessed with it."
                                            }
                                        ]
